#doc (Manual) "Verified Air: Business Rules for Review" =>
%%%
authors := ["Sam Dengler"]
shortTitle := "Verified Air"
%%%

This document describes airline offer and order rules as a Lean model, for review by the Offer/Order team.
There is one chapter per requirement. Requirements OO-001 to OO-003 are the pilot rules; requirements whose IDs start with ONE follow IATA's public ONE Order material.
Every rule, guarantee, and example in them is drawn from the model and checked when the document is built.

